  ('balancer', 'Balancer', 'defi-systems-architecture', 'dexs-liquidity-protocols', 'https://balancer.fi', ARRAY['Vault-based onchain swaps across custom pools']::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], '{"description": "A programmable liquidity protocol enabling multi-asset and weighted pools, optimized for portfolio-style liquidity and capital-efficient baskets.", "extras": {"Capital Efficiency Design Concentrated liquidity ranges (v3); uniform liquidity (v2)": "Weighted pools, boosted pools, composable pools", "DEX Model Concentrated Liquidity AMM (v3); Constant Product AMM (v2 legacy)": "Programmable / Weighted AMM", "Dependency Concentration Risk High reliance by downstream protocols; High LP concentration risk in key pools; High MEV exposure by design": "Medium–High concentration risk in specific pool types (LSTs, DAO-managed pools)", "Fee Control Fee tiers are protocol-defined; fee switches and new parameters are governance-controlled (not all activated)": "Governance-set pool fees; flexible per-pool configuration", "Governance Model DAO token governance (UNI)": "DAO token governance (BAL)", "Historical Stress Behavior Proven resilience through volatility events (2020–2024); stress typically expresses as fee spikes and LP reallocation, not protocol failure": "Generally resilient; stress expresses via pool rebalancing and fee volatility rather than protocol failure", "Integration Footprint Lending liquidations, yield strategies, derivatives pricing, oracle references, treasury swaps": "LST liquidity, DAO treasury management, index-like exposure, lending collateral pricing", "Launch Year 2018 (v1); v2 2020; v3 2021": "2020", "Liquidity Providers Permissionless LPs": "Permissionless LPs; DAO-managed pools", "MEV Exposure Profile High (classic AMM MEV exposure: sandwiching, arbitrage)": "Medium (Vault + batch swaps reduce some MEV, but not eliminated)", "Maintaining Organization Uniswap DAO (governance) with development by Uniswap Labs": "Balancer DAO with Balancer Labs as core